    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<h1>JOIN OUR DISCORD</h1><p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1>Get ready to flex those skills! Knock &amp; Run is a fun PvP game where you gotta hit your opponents with your balls to emerge victorious.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2013130/extras/91590b041519a638fc96e9c80b567fb7.avif?t=1687158818\" /></div><br><br><strong>Objective:</strong><br>Be the last player remaining on the field to win the game!<br><br><strong>Instructions:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Transform a white ball to your color by touching it.<br></li><li>Use the balls in your color to knock down other players.<br></li><li>Keep playing until only one player is left standing, and that player will be declared the winner!</li></ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2013130/extras/5dc7e41f50c000136229cb742a09e775.avif?t=1687158818\" /></div><br><br><strong>Features</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Unique casual game, score as much as you can. Endless fun!<br></li><li>Local multiplayer - up to 4 players<br></li><li>5 types of maps, procedurally generated</li></ul><br><strong>Credits</strong><br>Narrator: Trenton Castillo<br><br>We would like to extend our gratitude to Maya for her valuable support and creative ideas, and to Oded for contributing to the initial concept!",
    "about_the_game": "Get ready to flex those skills! Knock &amp; Run is a fun PvP game where you gotta hit your opponents with your balls to emerge victorious.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2013130/extras/91590b041519a638fc96e9c80b567fb7.avif?t=1687158818\" /></div><br><br><strong>Objective:</strong><br>Be the last player remaining on the field to win the game!<br><br><strong>Instructions:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Transform a white ball to your color by touching it.<br></li><li>Use the balls in your color to knock down other players.<br></li><li>Keep playing until only one player is left standing, and that player will be declared the winner!</li></ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2013130/extras/5dc7e41f50c000136229cb742a09e775.avif?t=1687158818\" /></div><br><br><strong>Features</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Unique casual game, score as much as you can. Endless fun!<br></li><li>Local multiplayer - up to 4 players<br></li><li>5 types of maps, procedurally generated</li></ul><br><strong>Credits</strong><br>Narrator: Trenton Castillo<br><br>We would like to extend our gratitude to Maya for her valuable support and creative ideas, and to Oded for contributing to the initial concept!",
    "short_description": "Grab an orb and prepare to fight - It's about to go down. Compete your friends and knock down everyone!",
